Package: libbitcoin-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: libbitcoin developers <eric@voskuil.org>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/libbitcoin/libbitcoin-server
Description: Bitcoin Full Node and Query Server
 Libbitcoin Server (bs) is a full bitcoin node and query server. The package
 contains processor variants of bs, and installation links the best variant
 the processor supports as /usr/bin/bs.
